            "line": 462,
            "text": "theorem signed_tensor_bounds {σ κ : ℝ} (hσ : 1 / 5 ≤ σ)\n    (hκsmall : κ ≤ 1 / 100000)\n    (f : SignedFamily s P (1 / 2) (17 / 25) (1 / 2 + σ - κ) (1 + σ - 2 * κ))\n    (a : Assembly f) :\n    TensorClass s (1 + σ - κ) (incrementTensor f a) ∧\n      TensorClass s (1 + σ + 17 / 100 + κ) (remainderTensor f a)"
          }
